Package: MetaboResolveR
Type: Package
Title: Human Plasma Metabolite Annotation Resolution
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("OpenAI", "Codex", email = "support@openai.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: OpenAI Codex [aut, cre]
Maintainer: OpenAI Codex <support@openai.com>
Description: Resolves post-identification untargeted human plasma metabolomics
    tables into plasma-aware, evidence-scored annotation outputs. The package
    is designed for LC-MS annotation review workflows and emphasizes reference
    evidence, identifier-aware matching, exogenous flagging, conservative lipid
    handling, and transparent confidence classes.
